You should be able to run the code by executing

Python main.py Test0.txt
        or
Python3 main.py Test0.txt

You will need the "nidaqmx" and "keyboard" packages in order to run this program.
Get them with:
python -m pip install nidaqmx
python -m pip install keyboard

